\\common_cpp.lib`. Recipe PATH set to include `$(BINDIR)\\common`. Good.\n\nEdge: When linking the DLL, the .exp/.lib/.pdb/.dll all created in build\\debug\\common. gitignored. Good.\n\nNow let me write it up.\n\nI'll present the plan and ask for go-ahead implicitly (plan mode — the user will approve/switch to build mode). I might ask one final clarifying thing: whether to delete .bat files at the end (she may want to keep them until контрольная). Actually § 4.9 п.1 mandates removal; I'll propose removal but flag it as her call (could keep until контрольная точка). Actually let me just include it with rationale and note she can defer.\n\nLet me write the final plan.",
